<h2>⏰ Event Reminder: {{eventTitle}}</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{attendee.name}}</strong>,</p>

<p>This is a reminder that <strong>{{eventTitle}}</strong> is {{daysUntil}} day(s) from now!</p>

<div class="ticket-info">
  <h3>Event Information:</h3>
  <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{formatDate eventDate}}<br>
  <strong>Venue:</strong> {{venueName}}<br>
  <strong>Ticket Type:</strong> {{attendee.tierName}}<br>
  <strong>Ticket Number:</strong> {{attendee.ticketNumber}}</p>
</div>

<p>
  <a href="{{googleMapsLink}}" class="button">📍 Get Directions</a>
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/my-tickets/{{attendee.ticketNumber}}" class="button">🎟️ View Ticket</a>
</p>

<p><strong>What to bring:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Your QR code (digital or printed)</li>
  <li>Valid ID for verification</li>
  <li>Your phone with the ticket</li>
</ul>

<p>Get ready for an amazing experience! 🎉</p>